  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996, according to local accounts, strange beings were seen in an empty fenced lot in Varginha, a town in Brazil. Italo Venturelli, a surgeon from the town speaking on Jesse Michels' podcast, says that the story goes that a writer named J. J. Benítez later went to the lot and collected soil to check it for radioactive material. The point of the test, as told, was to look for physical traces left behind by whatever had been there."
